  - h2 "Positioning before product" → "Choose a segment where you can be the reliable option: price, quality, or a specific vehicle class. Do not compete on price alone."
  - h2 "Differentiate on specification, not marketing" → "A repeatable specification — consistent CCA, capacity and finish — is the real differentiator buyers remember."
  - h2 "Lock the supply" → "A private-label program only works with a manufacturer that keeps repeat orders identical. Chengguang Energy's IATF 16949 quality system and 70+ country export experience are built for this."
  - h2 "Plan SKUs, not one-offs" → "A private-label line is a SKU plan across models, not a single container. Map the models to your market's standard family."
