dist/knowledge/oem-battery-moq-lead-time/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>OEM Battery MOQ &amp; Lead Time Explained | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="What MOQ and lead time mean for OEM battery orders, and how they are set — with Chengguang Energy’s reference terms."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-moq-lead-time/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="OEM Battery MOQ &#38; Lead Time Explained | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="What MOQ and lead time mean for OEM battery orders, and how they are set — with Chengguang Energy’s reference terms."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-moq-lead-time/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"OEM battery MOQ & lead time","description":"What MOQ and lead time mean for OEM battery orders, and how they are set — with Chengguang Energy’s reference terms.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-moq-lead-time/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"OEM battery MOQ & lead time","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-moq-lead-time/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">OEM battery MOQ &amp; lead time</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>OEM battery MOQ &amp; lead time</h1> <p class="lead">MOQ and lead time are set by production economics and container logistics, not by negotiation alone. Here is how they work.</p> <h2>What drives MOQ</h2> <p>Battery MOQ is usually tied to a container load, because shipping cost per unit collapses at FCL. Chengguang Energy&rsquo;s reference MOQ is 1 × 20ft container (approx. 600–800 units, model dependent).</p> <h2>What drives lead time</h2> <p>Lead time covers order confirmation, production and pre-shipment testing. Chengguang Energy&rsquo;s reference lead time is 30–45 days after order confirmation; custom-label orders add sampling time.</p> <h2>How to reduce both</h2> <ul> <li>Order in full container multiples</li> <li>Consolidate mixed models into one container</li> <li>Confirm specification early to avoid sampling delays</li> <li>Plan around the harvest-free, year-round production of lead-acid batteries</li> </ul> <p><a href="/contact/">Confirm MOQ and lead time &rarr;</a> · <a href="/knowledge/how-oem-battery-programs-work/">How OEM programs run &rarr;</a></p> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Confirm MOQ and lead time for your order</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>OEM Battery Specification Guide | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="A buyer’s guide to OEM battery specifications: standard family, voltage, capacity, CCA, dimensions, terminal, polarity and how to confirm values."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="OEM Battery Specification Guide | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="A buyer’s guide to OEM battery specifications: standard family, voltage, capacity, CCA, dimensions, terminal, polarity and how to confirm values."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"OEM battery specification guide","description":"A buyer’s guide to OEM battery specifications: standard family, voltage, capacity, CCA, dimensions, terminal, polarity and how to confirm values.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"OEM battery specification guide","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">OEM battery specification guide</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>OEM battery specification guide</h1> <p class="lead">A battery specification is only as useful as the fields you fix in advance. This guide explains each field buyers should confirm.</p> <h2>Standard family</h2> <p>Start with the standard your vehicles use: JIS, DIN, BCI, AS, SA. JIS models such as 65D26 and DIN/EN models such as H6 describe different naming and test conventions.</p> <h2>Voltage</h2> <p>Passenger-car starter batteries are usually 12V; heavy-duty applications can also use 6V. Confirm the system voltage of the target vehicle.</p> <h2>Capacity (Ah)</h2> <p>Capacity describes the battery&rsquo;s energy content over a defined discharge test. It must be read with the standard because the same physical size can carry different ratings across families.</p> <h2>CCA</h2> <p>Cold cranking amps indicate starting performance at low temperature. CCA values are test-method dependent and must carry a reference basis — for example JIS (-15&deg;C) or EN (-18&deg;C). Always confirm final CCA with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> <h2>Dimensions, terminal and polarity</h2> <p>Fix length &times; width &times; height in millimetres, terminal type and polarity. If a field is not yet known, mark it &ldquo;confirm on inquiry&rdquo; rather than guessing.</p> <h2>Reference models</h2> <div class="model-list"> <article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/65d26/">65D26 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 60 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">370 CCA (reference) · 256 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/65d26/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/65d23/">65D23 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 60 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">370 CCA (reference) · 230 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/65d23/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/80d26/">80D26 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 72 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">490 CCA (reference) · 256 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/80d26/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/105d31/">105D31 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 84 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">655 CCA (reference) · 305 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/105d31/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/115d31/">115D31 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 96 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">710 CCA (reference) · 305 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/115d31/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/h6/">H6 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">DIN/EN · 12V · 72 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">660 CCA (reference) · 278 × 175 × 190 mm</p> <a href="/data/h6/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/75d23/">75D23 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 72 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">465 CCA (reference) · 230 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/75d23/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/55b24/">55B24 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 48 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">370 CCA (reference) · 238 × 129 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/55b24/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/65b24/">65B24 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 50 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">370 CCA (reference) · 238 × 129 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/65b24/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/85d26/">85D26 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 84 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">520 CCA (reference) · 256 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/85d26/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/95d26/">95D26 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">JIS · 12V · 84 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">565 CCA (reference) · 256 × 175 × 220 mm</p> <a href="/data/95d26/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/h5/">H5 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">DIN/EN · 12V · 60 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">600 CCA (reference) · 242 × 175 × 190 mm</p> <a href="/data/h5/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/h7/">H7 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">DIN/EN · 12V · 84 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">760 CCA (reference) · 315 × 175 × 190 mm</p> <a href="/data/h7/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article><article class="model-card"> <h3><a href="/data/h8/">H8 Battery</a></h3> <p class="model-card__meta">DIN/EN · 12V · 96 Ah</p> <p class="model-card__meta">900 CCA (reference) · 352 × 175 × 190 mm</p> <a href="/data/h8/">View specification <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a> </article> </div> <p>Specifications above are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer. <a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Use the battery finder &rarr;</a></p> <h2>Dingwei Battery view</h2> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002). Chengguang Energy manufactures to JIS, DIN, BCI, AS and SA standards.</p> <p><a href="/oem/">Start an OEM program &rarr;</a></p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Finalize your battery specification</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>OEM vs ODM vs Private Label | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="OEM, ODM and private label describe different levels of design control. Compare them and choose the right path for your battery brand."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="OEM vs ODM vs Private Label | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="OEM, ODM and private label describe different levels of design control. Compare them and choose the right path for your battery brand."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"OEM vs ODM vs private label","description":"OEM, ODM and private label describe different levels of design control. Compare them and choose the right path for your battery brand.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"OEM vs ODM vs private label","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">OEM vs ODM vs private label</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>OEM vs ODM vs private label</h1> <p class="lead">All three models let you sell batteries under your own brand. The difference is how much of the specification and design you control.</p> <h2>Definitions</h2> <ul> <li><strong>OEM</strong> — you define the specification and branding; the manufacturer builds to your requirements.</li> <li><strong>ODM</strong> — the manufacturer owns a ready design; you select it, adapt branding and optionally request changes.</li> <li><strong>Private label</strong> — a supplied product carries your name, label and packaging.</li> </ul> <h2>Which one fits your sourcing goal</h2> <div class="grid grid--3"> <div class="card"><h3>Choose OEM</h3><p>When you have a defined technical specification and need exact control.</p></div> <div class="card"><h3>Choose ODM</h3><p>When you want a proven platform and faster time to market.</p></div> <div class="card"><h3>Choose private label</h3><p>When the priority is brand identity on an existing product.</p></div> </div> <h2>What stays constant</h2> <p>Whichever path you choose, verify the standard family, voltage, capacity, CCA, dimensions, terminal layout, certifications and export terms before ordering.</p> <p><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Use the supplier checklist &rarr;</a> · <a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Build a clean specification &rarr;</a></p> <h2>Dingwei Battery view</h2> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002). The program can be shaped as OEM, ODM or private label depending on the specification you already control.</p> <p><a href="/oem/">Explore OEM programs &rarr;</a> · <a href="/private-label/">Private-label programs &rarr;</a></p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Choose the right battery program</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>What Is an OEM Battery? | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="An OEM battery is built to the buyer’s specification and brand. Learn how OEM batteries differ from ODM and private-label supply, with a Dingwei Battery view."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="What Is an OEM Battery? | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="An OEM battery is built to the buyer’s specification and brand. Learn how OEM batteries differ from ODM and private-label supply, with a Dingwei Battery view."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"What is an OEM battery?","description":"An OEM battery is built to the buyer’s specification and brand. Learn how OEM batteries differ from ODM and private-label supply, with a Dingwei Battery view.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"What is an OEM battery?","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/" aria-current="page">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">What is an OEM battery?</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>What is an OEM battery?</h1> <p class="lead">An OEM battery is a battery produced to the buyer&rsquo;s specification and sold under the buyer&rsquo;s brand — rather than the factory&rsquo;s own label.</p> <h2>The core idea</h2> <p>OEM stands for original equipment manufacturer. In battery sourcing, OEM means the supplier manufactures to an agreed specification: voltage, capacity, CCA, standard family, case size, terminal layout and labelling. The buyer controls the product definition and brand.</p> <h2>How OEM differs from ODM and private label</h2> <ul> <li><strong>OEM</strong> — you bring the specification; the manufacturer builds to it.</li> <li><strong>ODM</strong> — the manufacturer offers an existing design you can brand and adjust.</li> <li><strong>Private label</strong> — your identity is applied to a supplied product platform.</li> </ul> <p><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">Read the full OEM vs ODM vs private-label comparison &rarr;</a></p> <h2>What goes into an OEM battery specification</h2> <p>At minimum, an OEM battery project defines the standard family (JIS, DIN, BCI, AS or SA), voltage, capacity (Ah), CCA, dimensions, terminal type and polarity. Reference models such as 65D26 or H6 are often used as a starting point.</p> <p><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">See the OEM battery specification guide &rarr;</a></p> <h2>Dingwei Battery and its manufacturer</h2> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002). Chengguang Energy operates a 200,000 m² facility with 18 lines and manufactures to JIS, DIN, BCI, AS and SA standards.</p> <p><a href="/oem/">Explore OEM programs &rarr;</a></p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Define your OEM battery specification</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/oem-battery-rfq-guide/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>OEM Battery RFQ Guide: Write an Effective Request for Quotation | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="How to write an OEM battery RFQ that gets accurate quotes: specification fields, volume, packaging, certification and delivery requirements."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-rfq-guide/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="OEM Battery RFQ Guide: Write an Effective Request for Quotation | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="How to write an OEM battery RFQ that gets accurate quotes: specification fields, volume, packaging, certification and delivery requirements."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-rfq-guide/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"OEM battery RFQ guide","description":"How to write an OEM battery RFQ that gets accurate quotes: specification fields, volume, packaging, certification and delivery requirements.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-rfq-guide/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"OEM battery RFQ guide","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-rfq-guide/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">OEM battery RFQ guide</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>OEM battery RFQ guide</h1> <p class="lead">A complete RFQ gets you comparable quotes; a vague one gets you a range so wide it is useless. Include these fields.</p> <h2>The specification block</h2> <ul> <li>Battery type (SLI, AGM, EFB, heavy-duty)</li> <li>Standard family (JIS, DIN, BCI, AS, SA)</li> <li>Reference model (e.g. 65D26)</li> <li>Voltage, capacity (Ah), CCA</li> <li>Case size, terminal type, polarity</li> </ul> <h2>The volume block</h2> <ul> <li>Annual volume</li> <li>First order quantity</li> <li>Forecast by model if mixed</li> <li>Target market (affects standard and certification)</li> </ul> <h2>The branding block</h2> <ul> <li>Private label or OEM</li> <li>Label artwork and packaging</li> <li>Pallet configuration</li> <li>Multi-language documentation</li> </ul> <h2>The commercial block</h2> <ul> <li>Target price (optional)</li> <li>Incoterms</li> <li>Payment terms</li> <li>Delivery schedule</li> </ul> <p><a href="/contact/">Send your RFQ &rarr;</a> · <a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Build a clean specification &rarr;</a></p> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Send a complete OEM RFQ</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/how-audit-battery-factory/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>How to Audit a Lead-Acid Battery Factory | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="How to audit a lead-acid battery factory for OEM sourcing: certifications, production capability, quality control, testing and export readiness."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-audit-battery-factory/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="How to Audit a Lead-Acid Battery Factory | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="How to audit a lead-acid battery factory for OEM sourcing: certifications, production capability, quality control, testing and export readiness."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-audit-battery-factory/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"How to audit a lead-acid battery factory","description":"How to audit a lead-acid battery factory for OEM sourcing: certifications, production capability, quality control, testing and export readiness.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-audit-battery-factory/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"How to audit a lead-acid battery factory","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-audit-battery-factory/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">How to audit a lead-acid battery factory</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>How to audit a lead-acid battery factory</h1> <p class="lead">A factory audit is how you verify that a battery manufacturer can deliver your specification repeatably — not just once. Run these checks before committing volume.</p> <h2>Certifications</h2> <p>Request current certificates, not claims. Chengguang Energy holds IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <h2>Production capability</h2> <p>Check factory area, number of production lines and daily output against your annual volume. Chengguang Energy operates a 200,000 m² plant with 18 lines producing 40,000+ batteries per day.</p> <h2>Quality control &amp; testing</h2> <ul> <li>Incoming material inspection</li> <li>In-process checks (grid casting, pasting, curing, formation)</li> <li>100% end-of-line electrical test</li> <li>Batch traceability</li> <li>Lab testing for CCA and capacity</li> </ul> <h2>Export readiness</h2> <p>Confirm export experience, documentation capability and destination markets. Chengguang Energy exports to 70+ countries.</p> <h2>What to bring home from an audit</h2> <ul> <li>Current certificates</li> <li>Sample of a recent production run</li> <li>A specification sheet for your reference model</li> <li>Agreed commercial terms</li> </ul> <p><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Use the supplier checklist &rarr;</a> · <a href="/factory/">See the factory capability &rarr;</a></p> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Put Dingwei Battery through your audit</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Choosing an OEM Battery Manufacturer | Dingwei</title><meta name="description" content="A practical method for choosing an OEM battery manufacturer: standards, certifications, factory capability, sampling and export terms."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="Choosing an OEM Battery Manufacturer | Dingwei"><meta property="og:description" content="A practical method for choosing an OEM battery manufacturer: standards, certifications, factory capability, sampling and export terms."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"How to choose an OEM battery manufacturer","description":"A practical method for choosing an OEM battery manufacturer: standards, certifications, factory capability, sampling and export terms.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"How to choose an OEM battery manufacturer","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">How to choose an OEM battery manufacturer</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>How to choose an OEM battery manufacturer</h1> <p class="lead">Choose a manufacturer that can match your standard, hold quality systems, and repeat your specification order after order.</p> <h2>1. Match the standard family</h2> <p>Your market determines the standard: JIS, DIN, BCI, AS or SA. Confirm the factory regularly produces that family rather than treating your order as a one-off.</p> <h2>2. Check quality systems</h2> <p>Ask which certifications the manufacturer holds. For automotive supply, IATF 16949 is the relevant quality system; ISO 9001 covers general quality management.</p> <p>Chengguang Energy holds IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001 and CE.</p> <h2>3. Verify factory capability</h2> <p>Look at plant size, line count, daily output, export experience and whether the facility can support your volume. Chengguang Energy operates a 200,000 m² facility with 18 lines, producing 40,000+ batteries per day and exporting to 70+ countries.</p> <h2>4. Define the specification before quoting</h2> <p>Fix voltage, capacity, CCA, case size, terminal and polarity first. Ambiguous specifications produce samples that cannot be fairly compared.</p> <p><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Read the specification guide &rarr;</a></p> <h2>5. Evaluate sampling and terms</h2> <p>Confirm the sampling step, lead time, payment and warranty before committing. Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> <p><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Use the supplier checklist &rarr;</a> · <a href="/oem/">OEM capability &rarr;</a></p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Evaluate Dingwei Battery as your manufacturer</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/oem-battery-development-process/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>The OEM Battery Development Process | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="The step-by-step OEM battery development process — from requirement to shipment — and where buyers should be involved."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-development-process/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="The OEM Battery Development Process | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="The step-by-step OEM battery development process — from requirement to shipment — and where buyers should be involved."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-development-process/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"The OEM battery development process","description":"The step-by-step OEM battery development process — from requirement to shipment — and where buyers should be involved.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-development-process/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"The OEM battery development process","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-development-process/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">The OEM battery development process</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>The OEM battery development process</h1> <p class="lead">OEM development is a gated process. Understanding the stages tells you where to be involved and where to insist on sign-off.</p> <h2>The seven stages</h2> <ol> <li>Consultation</li> <li>Specification</li> <li>Design &amp; branding</li> <li>Sampling</li> <li>Mass production</li> <li>Quality inspection</li> <li>Logistics &amp; shipping</li> </ol> <h2>Where buyers should be involved</h2> <ul> <li>Specification — sign off every parameter</li> <li>Sampling — test before approving</li> <li>Quality inspection — agree the acceptance criteria</li> <li>Shipment — confirm documentation</li> </ul> <h2>Why gates matter</h2> <p>Each gate is a decision point. Skipping a gate is how a specification drifts and a repeat order comes back different.</p> <p><a href="/oem/">Explore OEM programs &rarr;</a> · <a href="/contact/">Talk through your development project &rarr;</a></p> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Plan your OEM development process</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>OEM Battery Supplier Checklist | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="A supplier evaluation checklist for OEM battery sourcing: specification, certifications, factory capability, sampling, terms and repeatability."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="OEM Battery Supplier Checklist | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="A supplier evaluation checklist for OEM battery sourcing: specification, certifications, factory capability, sampling, terms and repeatability."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"OEM battery supplier checklist","description":"A supplier evaluation checklist for OEM battery sourcing: specification, certifications, factory capability, sampling, terms and repeatability.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"OEM battery supplier checklist","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">OEM battery supplier checklist</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>OEM battery supplier checklist</h1> <p class="lead">Run a supplier through these checks before you commit to an OEM battery order.</p> <h2>Specification</h2> <ul> <li>Standard family confirmed: JIS, DIN, BCI, AS or SA.</li> <li>Voltage, capacity (Ah) and CCA agreed in writing.</li> <li>Case size, terminal type and polarity defined.</li> <li>Reference model or drawing attached to the order.</li> </ul> <h2>Certifications</h2> <p>Request current certificates rather than marketing claims. Chengguang Energy holds IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <h2>Factory capability</h2> <ul> <li>Factory area and number of production lines.</li> <li>Daily output versus your annual volume.</li> <li>Export experience and destination markets.</li> </ul> <p>Chengguang Energy operates a 200,000 m² plant with 18 lines and exports to 70+ countries.</p> <h2>Commercial terms</h2> <ul> <li>MOQ: 1 × 20ft container (approx. 600–800 units, model dependent).</li> <li>Lead time: 30–45 days after order confirmation.</li> <li>Payment: T/T (30% deposit, 70% before shipment) or L/C at sight.</li> <li>Incoterms: FOB Tianjin / CFR / CIF.</li> <li>Warranty: 12 months from bill of lading date.</li> </ul> <h2>Repeatability</h2> <p>Confirm how the manufacturer keeps subsequent orders identical to the approved sample — label, packaging, specification and quality.</p> <p><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">How to choose a manufacturer &rarr;</a> · <a href="/oem/">Dingwei OEM programs &rarr;</a></p> <p>Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Put Dingwei Battery through your checklist</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tianjin / Shanghai</li> <li><a href="/factory/">Factory overview</a></li> <li><a href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="site-footer__legal"> <p>Certifications referenced on this site are held by Chengguang Energy: IATF 16949, ISO 9001, ISO 45001, OHSAS 18001, CE.</p> <p>&copy; 2026 Dingwei Battery. Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.. All specifications are for reference; confirm final values with the manufacturer before ordering.</p> </div> </div> </footer> </body></html>
dist/knowledge/private-label-battery-strategy/index.html:1:<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"> <head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Private-Label Battery Strategy | Dingwei Battery</title><meta name="description" content="A private-label battery strategy framework: positioning, differentiation, specification discipline and repeatable supply."><link rel="canonical" href="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/private-label-battery-strategy/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:title" content="Private-Label Battery Strategy | Dingwei Battery"><meta property="og:description" content="A private-label battery strategy framework: positioning, differentiation, specification discipline and repeatable supply."><meta property="og:url" content="https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/private-label-battery-strategy/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0f1f3a"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><script type="application/ld+json">[{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"Private-label battery strategy","description":"A private-label battery strategy framework: positioning, differentiation, specification discipline and repeatable supply.","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dingwei Battery","url":"https://dingweibattery.com"},"datePublished":"2026-09-01","dateModified":"2026-09-01","mainEntityOfPage":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/private-label-battery-strategy/"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Private-label battery strategy","item":"https://dingweibattery.com/knowledge/private-label-battery-strategy/"}]}]</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.Cu8Dk6iq.css"></head> <body> <header class="site-header"> <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a> <div class="container site-header__bar"> <a class="brand" href="/"> <span class="brand__mark">DB</span> <span>Dingwei Battery</span> </a> <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary"> <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/oem/">OEM</a><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy Duty</a><a href="/factory/">Factory</a><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">Knowledge</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a> <a class="btn btn--light" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </nav> </div> </header> <nav class="breadcrumbs container" aria-label="Breadcrumb"> <ol> <li><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li> <li> <span aria-current="page">Private-label battery strategy</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <main id="main">    <section class="section container prose"> <span class="tag">Knowledge</span> <h1>Private-label battery strategy</h1> <p class="lead">Private label is not just putting your name on a battery — it is a supply and positioning strategy.</p> <h2>Positioning before product</h2> <p>Choose a segment where you can be the reliable option: price, quality, or a specific vehicle class. Do not compete on price alone.</p> <h2>Differentiate on specification, not marketing</h2> <p>A repeatable specification — consistent CCA, capacity and finish — is the real differentiator buyers remember.</p> <h2>Lock the supply</h2> <p>A private-label program only works with a manufacturer that keeps repeat orders identical. Chengguang Energy&rsquo;s IATF 16949 quality system and 70+ countries export experience are built for this. Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> <h2>Plan SKUs, not one-offs</h2> <p>A private-label line is a SKU plan across models, not a single container. Map the models to your market&rsquo;s standard family.</p> <p><a href="/private-label/">Explore private-label programs &rarr;</a> · <a href="/contact/">Plan your SKUs with us &rarr;</a></p> </section> <section class="section--tight"> <div class="container"> <div class="callout"> <h2>Build your private-label battery strategy</h2> <p style="margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;color:#d7e0ec">Tell us your specification, target market and annual volume. We will prepare an OEM or private-label program for review.</p> <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request OEM Quote</a> </div> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="site-footer__grid"> <div> <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand__mark">DB</span><span>Dingwei Battery</span></a> <p style="margin-top:0.8rem">Dingwei Battery provides OEM and private-label battery programs manufactured by Chengguang Energy (founded 2002).</p> </div> <div> <h3>Programs</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/oem/">OEM Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/car-batteries/">Car Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/oem/truck-batteries/">Truck Batteries</a></li> <li><a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/heavy-duty-batteries/">Heavy-Duty Batteries</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Resources</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li><a href="/knowledge/what-is-oem-battery/">What Is an OEM Battery?</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-vs-odm-vs-private-label/">OEM vs ODM vs Private Label</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/how-choose-oem-battery-manufacturer/">Choosing a Manufacturer</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-supplier-checklist/">Supplier Checklist</a></li> <li><a href="/knowledge/oem-battery-specification-guide/">Specification Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/tools/battery-finder/">Battery Finder</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <h3>Manufacturer</h3> <ul class="site-footer__list"> <li>Chengguang Energy (founded 2002)</li> <li>Jinzhou Chengguang Power Source Co., Ltd.</li> <li>Jinzhou, Hebei, China</li> <li>Export ports: Tian